{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>Retro Relics</i></strong>, you follow in the footsteps of your late Grandpa, a passionate metal detectorist. Explore nature and search for various relics with your metal detector. Roam freely with no time limits - detect, dig, help others find their lost belongings, and complete your coin and relics collection! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/8dc82f4e65efd91b0d17b3a741373fc3.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find relics from all eras (from bronze age to modern) with the help of your metal detector: coins, buttons, buckles, jewellery, military, religious relics and many more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/cb079ce3d6b481733f372cea154be4bc.poster.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/cb079ce3d6b481733f372cea154be4bc.webm?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/cb079ce3d6b481733f372cea154be4bc.mp4?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/c2b197123a6bfe9b1d18e9a044de6fe1.poster.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/c2b197123a6bfe9b1d18e9a044de6fe1.webm?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/c2b197123a6bfe9b1d18e9a044de6fe1.mp4?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/c53e9b403e9e4c503c41a218fdbcd32d.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mysteries of ancient ruins, explore lush forests, dusty fields and relax on a treasure hunt at the beach! Many animals can be spotted on your adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/2421820a9e0e0c217664df7ac944bc18.avif?t=1767807975\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/94cd0c0d2967bd0e10e1bb14826cdb03.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on numerous search missions for the local people in your town, including a sassy old lady at her villa, a slightly confused hunter and many more interesting characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/1097bab360bede9f86330a0556e941bc.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect more than 150 different relics from various eras and rarities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your personal museum and display your rarest and prettiest finds:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/e512c1bf2db8a8101f3b3c5a39af8949.avif?t=1767807975\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras_big/e512c1bf2db8a8101f3b3c5a39af8949.avif?t=1767807975 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/752b889fcc889b17e0d5d39b589478f4.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People don't only lose treasures - help nature by picking up trash and watch animals come back to their former habitats:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/fd5a35a4a7fac3e68f657a63d1e4e4e8.poster.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/fd5a35a4a7fac3e68f657a63d1e4e4e8.webm?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/fd5a35a4a7fac3e68f657a63d1e4e4e8.mp4?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/6ea9703ad57fd249852d67f21b082d7d.poster.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/6ea9703ad57fd249852d67f21b082d7d.webm?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/6ea9703ad57fd249852d67f21b082d7d.mp4?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/21bf27b1bfa4252cfc0a0385cdffe4fa.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At your cozy home you can sell artifacts, accept new missions via email, manage your collection and upgrade your gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/fc983033ccdb59692b515720d936d1b8.avif?t=1767807975\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras_big/fc983033ccdb59692b515720d936d1b8.avif?t=1767807975 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About me:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm Jonas, 31 years old, from Germany. I'm a solo developer working on Retro Relics in my free time. I'm a passionate metal detectorist myself and have many years of experience in the hobby. Many of the relics you can find in the game, I have found myself in real life.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/159146be1d7f4fa9cea01a5e56ea4c5b.poster.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/159146be1d7f4fa9cea01a5e56ea4c5b.webm?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/159146be1d7f4fa9cea01a5e56ea4c5b.mp4?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the community</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to take part in the development of Retro Relics, have feedback or ideas for the game, you are very welcome to my small Discord community:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/8c170ef432b48231e5120de9e19a1564.avif?t=1767807975\" width=184 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Wedding Ring found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072760/cebb570d42efca4bd09c1863c2e2d8e100566abd.jpg"},{"name":"Set of Silverware found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072760/f4bf838df88d64afaa2a8a2fc2b507a373db5de9.jpg"},{"name":"Gold Rush","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072760/7b1435f56eca56abcb05dece98e14b05e1fbc7e7.jpg"},{"name":"Good boy Shizo!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072760/4663540746df042c470ff70569039ff8fb8e642b.jpg"},{"name":"Sportscar Key found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072760/3ad79b832871078295e532a2e0f6650648d3c7a3.jpg"},{"name":"Turtles saved","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072760/7de3acabc17ab3cc788852dfde0459444ef86db5.jpg"},{"name":"Shark saved","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072760/bf7c4551697a51678988cae1c028a807a676e553.jpg"},{"name":"Ferrets saved","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072760/6807596dc8ab3789ccf164e69037deab7fa119b9.jpg"},{"name":"Peacocks saved","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072760/c06d2272bb9ae4d17d9c243c3737d5e4402655cf.jpg"},{"name":"Dragonflies saved","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3072760/161a4b834d5e136dc3efa3fbea44390073cf690a.jpg"}],"total":17},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3072760?t=1767807975","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3072760?t=1767807975","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/cf2b7b0fcc022fcb7584e602d69ea7707cefda43/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767807975","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/cf2b7b0fcc022fcb7584e602d69ea7707cefda43/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767807975","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3508680,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong><i>Retro Relics</i></strong>, you follow in the footsteps of your late Grandpa, a passionate metal detectorist. Explore nature and search for various relics with your metal detector. Roam freely with no time limits - detect, dig, help others find their lost belongings, and complete your coin and relics collection! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/8dc82f4e65efd91b0d17b3a741373fc3.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find relics from all eras (from bronze age to modern) with the help of your metal detector: coins, buttons, buckles, jewellery, military, religious relics and many more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/cb079ce3d6b481733f372cea154be4bc.poster.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/cb079ce3d6b4817