ur town, including a sassy old lady at her villa, a slightly confused hunter and many more interesting characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/1097bab360bede9f86330a0556e941bc.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect more than 150 different relics from various eras and rarities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your personal museum and display your rarest and prettiest finds:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/e512c1bf2db8a8101f3b3c5a39af8949.avif?t=1767807975\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras_big/e512c1bf2db8a8101f3b3c5a39af8949.avif?t=1767807975 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/752b889fcc889b17e0d5d39b589478f4.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People don't only lose treasures - help nature by picking up trash and watch animals come back to their former habitats:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/fd5a35a4a7fac3e68f657a63d1e4e4e8.poster.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/fd5a35a4a7fac3e68f657a63d1e4e4e8.webm?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/fd5a35a4a7fac3e68f657a63d1e4e4e8.mp4?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/6ea9703ad57fd249852d67f21b082d7d.poster.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/6ea9703ad57fd249852d67f21b082d7d.webm?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/6ea9703ad57fd249852d67f21b082d7d.mp4?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/21bf27b1bfa4252cfc0a0385cdffe4fa.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At your cozy home you can sell artifacts, accept new missions via email, manage your collection and upgrade your gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/fc983033ccdb59692b515720d936d1b8.avif?t=1767807975\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras_big/fc983033ccdb59692b515720d936d1b8.avif?t=1767807975 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About me:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm Jonas, 31 years old, from Germany. I'm a solo developer working on Retro Relics in my free time. I'm a passionate metal detectorist myself and have many years of experience in the hobby. Many of the relics you can find in the game, I have found myself in real life.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/159146be1d7f4fa9cea01a5e56ea4c5b.poster.avif?t=1767807975\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/159146be1d7f4fa9cea01a5e56ea4c5b.webm?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/159146be1d7f4fa9cea01a5e56ea4c5b.mp4?t=1767807975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the community</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to take part in the development of Retro Relics, have feedback or ideas for the game, you are very welcome to my small Discord community:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/extras/8c170ef432b48231e5120de9e19a1564.avif?t=1767807975\" width=184 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["HistoryXPlorer"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072760/4c5a1deb59a91751ec73c0e14fefa629f4565fbb/header.jpg?t=1767807975","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2,8 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvdia Geforce 1060 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2,8 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvdia Geforce 1060 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"h